            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.5.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " Imana yacu yadukoreye ibi vyose?’ Muzobabwire muti: ‘Ni kubera mwanteye ibitugu mugakorera izindi mana z’inyamahanga mu gihugu canyu bwite, ubu na ho muzokorera abanyamahanga mu gihugu kitari icanyu.’",
          "type": "text",
